#: admin/class-amswap-admin.php:247
msgid ""
"Agency accounts. Every role without a profile of its own (a dashed tab) gets "
"this menu too; its users are counted on its tab."
msgstr ""
"Bureau-accounts. Elke rol zonder eigen profiel (een gestippelde tab) krijgt "
